urnal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 n\u00b0 55", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La synchronisation est un test r\u00e9seau ; le visage perdu \u00e0 1,5 s reste P0. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : garder P2."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n56", "label": "n\u00b0 56 : score = moyenne mouthSmile, liss\u00e9e 200 ms", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mesure simple, lissage contre le bruit. \u00c9cart\u00e9s : maximum des deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s ; variante cheekSquint (compar\u00e9e en P0). \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n57", "label": "n\u00b0 57 : crit\u00e8res de rejet du calibrage", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rendre \u00ab qualit\u00e9 insuffisante \u00bb mesurable, emp\u00eacher un neutre truqu\u00e9. Essais illimit\u00e9s. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : limiter les essais. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n58", "label": "n\u00b0 58 : sourire confirm\u00e9 = s\u00e9rie \u2265 400 ms et \u2265 3 images", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dur\u00e9e ind\u00e9pendante de la cadence ; horodatage \u00e0 la premi\u00e8re image. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : horodatage \u00e0 la confirmation. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n59", "label": "n\u00b0 59 : jauge normalis\u00e9e, fig\u00e9e sur image invalide", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jauges comparables entre joueurs ; pas de pic cr\u00e9\u00e9 par une image invalide. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : jauge brute. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n60", "label": "n\u00b0 60 : image invalide = visage perdu ; faute dat\u00e9e d\u00e9but + 1,5 s", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Emp\u00eacher d'\u00e9chapper au jugement en tournant la t\u00eate. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : suivre le visage calibr\u00e9. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n61", "label": "n\u00b0 61 : simultan\u00e9it\u00e9 appliqu\u00e9e \u00e0 toute faute", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un seul ordre des fautes, quel que soit leur type. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : priorit\u00e9 du sourire sur la perte."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n62", "label": "n\u00b0 62 : faute compt\u00e9e si horodatage dans [t0 ; t0 + 60 s[", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pas de faute perdue \u00e0 la derni\u00e8re seconde. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : couper l'analyse \u00e0 60 s pile."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n63", "label": "n\u00b0 63 : arr\u00eat sur image prise par l'appareil du joueur", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 n\u00b0 63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Image nette et exacte, sans enregistrement. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : figer le flux re\u00e7u. Transmission et effacement modifi\u00e9s par n\u00b0 69."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n64", "label": "n\u00b0 64 : calibrage en deux temps, seuil propre au joueur", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 n\u00b0 64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un seuil fixe est injuste selon le visage. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : seuil fixe identique pour tous. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n65", "label": "n\u00b0 65 : perte continue > 5 s = faute", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 n\u00b0 65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sans cela, un joueur \u00e9chappe au jugement en sortant du champ. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : pertes sans limite de dur\u00e9e. \u00c0 confirmer (P0)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n66", "label": "n\u00b0 66 : W = max(200 ms, 2 \u00d7 erreur d'horloge)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 n\u00b0 66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La latence r\u00e9seau est du m\u00eame ordre que 200 ms. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : fen\u00eatre fixe de 200 ms. \u00c0 confirmer (P1)."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n67", "label": "n\u00b0 67 : deux visages = image invalide", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 n\u00b0 67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plus simple, emp\u00eache de se faire remplacer. \u00c9cart\u00e9 : suivre le visage le plus proche de la position calibr\u00e9e."}, {"id": "docs_d8_journal_decisions_n68", "label": "n\u00b0 68 : pics \u00e0 moins de 0,05 = manche nulle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D8-journal-decisions.md", "source_l